sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-wolfram-conus-textile-rule30> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-wolfram-conus-textile-rule30-repro-package> .
